KNOWNBUG
reset6.sv
--module top --bound 5 --reset top.counter
^\[top\.assert\.1\] top\.counter != 0: PROVED up to bound 5$
^\[top\.assert\.2\] always top\.counter != 3: REFUTED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
The reset condition reads no input; it holds in the initial state, and
its negation was required in every later state, which no path with more
than two states satisfies, as counter is incremented. Every property was
hence proved vacuously.
